{"sourceUrl":"https://hgxy.hfut.edu.cn/2026/0622/c9386a319798/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:59.979062+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://hgxy.hfut.edu.cn/2026/0622/c9386a319798/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>为促进各高校优秀大学生之间的交流与互动，加强有志于报考我院研究生的学生对学院人才培养和科学研究等方面的了解，合肥工业大学</span><span>化学与化工</span><span>学院</span><span>将于</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span><span>0</span><span>日</span><span>举办</span><span>“202</span><span>6</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营</span><span>”</span><span>活动，现诚挚邀请广大学子踊跃参加。</span></p><p><span>有关安排通知如下：</span></p><h2><span>一、申请资格</span></h2><p><span>申请者应是</span><span>202</span><span>7</span><span>届优秀应届本科毕业生，须当年报考合肥工业大学</span><span>化学与化工</span><span>学院研究生，并满足下列条件：</span></p><p><span>1.</span><span>拥护中国共产党领导、品德良好、遵纪守法、勤奋学习，愿意为社会主义现代化建设服务，思想政治表现优良；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>具有研究生推免资格高校的</span><span>化学、化工、材料</span><span><span>或相近专业本科三年级在校生（</span><span>202</span></span><span>7</span><span>届本科毕业生）</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>学习成绩优秀，具有良好的专业基础。有浓厚的科研兴趣和较强的创新能力。</span></p><h2><span>二、申请程序</span></h2><p><span>1.</span><span>在线填写合肥工大</span><span>化学与化工</span><span>学院</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营报名信息表</span><span><span>并提交申请材料（</span><span>pdf版）。</span></span><span>报名截止日期：</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span><span>年</span><span>7月</span></span><span>3</span><span>日</span><span></span></p><p><span>（</span><span>在线提交材料链接：</span><span>https://docs.qq.com/form/page/DVW1CUm5KTFhHSUhs</span><span>）</span></p><p><span>2.申请材料包括：</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）合肥工业大学</span><span>化学与化工</span><span>学院</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年优秀大学生夏令营申请表</span><span>（需签字、盖章）</span><span>，见附件</span><span>1</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）专家（副教授及以上职称）推荐信</span><span>1</span><span>封，模板见附件</span><span>2</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>3</span><span>）本科前两年半成绩单（需加盖学校</span><span>/</span><span>院教务部门或院系公章）；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>4</span><span>）身份证、学生证；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>5</span><span>）外语等级证书或其他体现外语水平的证明；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>6</span><span>）获奖证书；</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>7</span><span>）其他附件材料，包括参与科研项目证明、学术论文等（较厚的出版物等只提供封面）。</span></p><p><span>注：</span><span><span>申请者将申请材料按照（</span><span>1）～（7）</span></span><span>顺序</span><span><span>整理合成一个</span><span>PDF文件</span></span><span>上传。</span><span></span></p><h2><span> 3. </span><span>未按要求提交</span><span>申请</span><span>材料者，报名不予受理。</span></h2><h2><span>三、材料审核及</span><span>营员选拔</span></h2><p><span>材料审核和</span><span>夏令营营员入选</span><span>工作由合肥工业大学</span><span>化学与化工</span><span>学院负责，材料审核工作将于</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>5</span><span>日</span><span>结束</span><span>,。</span><span>夏令营</span><span>营员入选</span><span>名单将于</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>6</span><span>日</span><span>在</span><span>化学与化工</span><span>学院网站上公示，未公示同学</span><span>即为未入选营员</span><span>，不另行通知。</span></p><h2><span>四、活动安排</span></h2><h2><span>本次夏令营活动采取线下方式进行。内容包括学术报告、</span><span>座谈交流</span><span>等环节，具体日程安排待进一步通知。</span></h2><h2><span>五、其他说明</span><strong></strong></h2><p><span>1、学院为每位营员购买夏令营活动期间的人身意外伤害保险。</span></p><p><span>2、详细信息</span><span>请关注合肥工业大学</span><span>化学与化工学院</span><span><span>（</span><span>https://hgxy.hfut.edu.cn/）网站相关通知。</span></span></p><p><span>联系人：</span><span>安</span><span><span>老师</span></span><span>0551-6290</span><span>1547  </span></p><p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span><span>hxhgyanjiusheng@hfut.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><span>ＱＱ群：</span><span>126476170</span></span></p><p><span>                           </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>  </span><span>化学与化工学院研究生办公室</span></span></p><p><span>2026/6/22</span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hgxy.hfut.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://hgxy.hfut.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/65/8b/a72ea17a4a2e837f54b7b84f9130/7896d7ce-7060-48c6-97a2-3392bdd818ab.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：合肥工业大学化学与化工学院夏令营申请表.docx</a></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://hgxy.hfut.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif\"/><a href=\"https://hgxy.hfut.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/65/8b/a72ea17a4a2e837f54b7b84f9130/4313bdc6-d205-493a-b34e-1199fd527fa6.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：合肥工业大学化学与化工学院夏令营专家推荐书.doc</a></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"8c28aa569be74a9ceef7115d4da68c331a05e2f71288b2d5c238dd3b842b56b0","textLength":1085,"sourceSha256":"be020a57ec4e73d5ed69cbfbd89f3d02f464e17cec6dcf1cc876cc7643e2d08a","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-37141f04ae34a4acdea4","title":"2026年合肥工业大学化学与化工学院2026年优秀大学生夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:50:59.979062+00:00"}
